28
00:03:13.638 --> 00:03:19.408
Kendall Testagent: Great, I'll leave the numbers to your lender. Does your preapproval need updating for Utah?

29
00:03:20.108 --> 00:03:26.262
Ellis Fakewell: Rory said he can lend in Utah. He'll update the letter when we have an address.

30
00:03:26.962 --> 00:03:41.192
Kendall Testagent: Perfect. Now, before we look at anything, even on video, we need a written buyer agreement in place. It says I'm representing you and what my brokerage is paid. I'll send it tonight by email for e-signature.

31
00:03:41.892 --> 00:03:46.123
Jordan Fakewell's iPad: Can we read it first? I want to go through it.

32
00:03:46.823 --> 00:03:55.669
Kendall Testagent: Absolutely. Read it, ask me anything. It just has to be signed before our first tour, and that includes a live video tour.

33
00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.969
Ellis Fakewell: Makes sense.

34
00:03:58.669 --> 00:04:06.746
Kendall Testagent: So when do you want to see something? I could do live video tours this week of a couple that fit.

35
00:04:07.446 --> 00:04:09.046
Jordan Fakewell's iPad: Wednesday? After work.

36
00:04:09.746 --> 00:04:13.208
Kendall Testagent: Wednesday at 5 my time, so 4 your time?

37
00:04:13.908 --> 00:04:15.508
Ellis Fakewell: 4 Pacific, yes.

38
00:04:16.208 --> 00:04:18.515
Kendall Testagent: And then your trip out here.

39
00:04:19.215 --> 00:04:23.446
Jordan Fakewell's iPad: We fly in December 4th, Friday, and leave Sunday the 6th.

40
00:04:24.146 --> 00:04:29.531
Kendall Testagent: Okay, so we tour in person Saturday the 5th, all day if you want.

41
00:04:30.231 --> 00:04:31.831
Ellis Fakewell: All day.

42
00:04:32.531 --> 00:04:50.608
Kendall Testagent: All right. So from me: the buyer agreement tonight, your search with RV parking and the HOA filter by Monday, the two school links, and I'll pick the two homes for Wednesday's video tour and send them Tuesday. From you: read and sign the agreement before Wednesday.

43
00:04:51.308 --> 00:04:55.538
Jordan Fakewell's iPad: Sounds great. Text me the Wednesday link, I'm bad with email.

44
00:04:56.238 --> 00:04:57.838
Kendall Testagent: Will do. Talk soon.
